# Mass Polymorph: "Exile all creatures you control, then reveal cards from the top of your library until you reveal that
# many creature cards. Put all creature cards revealed this way onto the battlefield, then shuffle the rest of the
# revealed cards into your library." Bot1 exiles two Llanowar Elves and reveals two Islands and two creature cards, so
# Elvish Mystic and Birds of Paradise arrive while the Islands stay in the library. Bot2's Llanowar Elves is not a
# creature Bot1 controls, so it stays where it is.

